      "description": "The cuda-arch package represents a minimum supported target CUDA architecture / compute capability. Depending on this package declares that a CUDA device with at least the declared compute capability is required.\nSimilar to how the cuda-version package is constrained by the __cuda virtual package, the cuda-arch package is constrained by the __cuda_arch virtual package. The __cuda_arch virtual package provides the minimum compute capability of the available CUDA devices detected on the system. The cuda-arch package allows packages to express a minimum supported compute capability without depending on __cuda_arch directly.",
